---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---

<Layout title="about us" description="About cueory and our mission.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-10 py-8">
    <div class="space-y-2">
      <h1 class="text-2xl text-ink">about cueory</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-ink-soft">{site.tagline}</p>
    </div>

    <section class="space-y-3" aria-labelledby="mission-heading">
      <h2 id="mission-heading" class="text-xl text-ink">our mission</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-ink-soft">
        Nursing school is hard enough. Cueory makes studying simpler: short lessons, cards you can sort, questions that
        explain themselves, an anatomy lab you can turn in your hands, and a few daily games for the days you only have
        five minutes. All of it is free, with no ads and no trackers following you around the web.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3" aria-labelledby="who-heading">
      <h2 id="who-heading" class="text-xl text-ink">who we are</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-ink-soft">
        Cueory is independent. It isn't run by a school, a publisher or a test maker. It was started by a nursing
        student who wanted a calmer, clearer way to study fundamentals and med-surg, and who still makes every decision
        about what the site is and isn't. It is built in the open: the code is public, and anyone can read how it works.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3" aria-labelledby="content-heading">
      <h2 id="content-heading" class="text-xl text-ink">how content is made</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-ink-soft">
        Lessons, cards and questions are written in small batches and reviewed before they go live. Where a lesson
        hasn't been reviewed yet, it says so on the page. Anatomy models come from an openly licensed source, named where
        they appear. Nothing is generated on the fly, and nothing goes public without a "Flag or comment" button, so if
        something looks wrong you can tell us from the page itself and we'll check it.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3" aria-labelledby="support-heading">
      <h2 id="support-heading" class="text-xl text-ink">support us</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-ink-soft">
        Cueory costs almost nothing to run and is paid for out of pocket, with help from tips. Everything on Cueory is free
        today. If it has helped you and you'd like to help keep it free for the next student, a tip goes a
        long way. Sharing it with a classmate helps just as much.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-4">
        <a href="/support" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center underline text-sm text-ink">
          visit our support page
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
